{"root":{"data":{"id":"djdkhgx8fzk0","created":1781927230974,"text":"建设社会主义生态文明","font-size":32},"children":[{"data":{"id":"djdkjezodvc0","created":1781927383496,"text":"坚持人与自然和谐共生","layout":null,"font-size":32},"children":[{"data":{"id":"djdkjljvny00","created":1781927397779,"text":"生态兴则文明兴","layout":null,"font-size":32},"children":[{"data":{"id":"djdkjp2kwtc0","created":1781927405440,"text":"  - 自然是生命之母， 人与自然是生命共同体","layout":null,"font-size":32},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"djdkjp2ltug0","created":1781927405441,"text":"  - 生态环境变化直接影响文明的兴衰演替  ","layout":null,"font-size":32},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"djdkjp2lll40","created":1781927405441,"text":"  - 生态文明是人类文明发展的历史趋势  ","layout":null,"font-size":32},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"djdkjp2ltlk0","created":1781927405441,"text":"  - 绵延 5000 多年的中华文明孕育着丰富的生态文化","layout":null,"font-size":32},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"id":"djdkjnk3mzc0","created":1781927402146,"text":"2. 绿水青山就是金山银山","layout":null,"font-size":32},"children":[{"data":{"id":"djdkjuglx3s0","created":1781927417172,"text":"  - 生态环境问题归根到底是经济发展方式和生活方式问题  ","layout":null,"font-size":32},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"djdkjuglpk00","created":1781927417172,"text":"  - 表面上，生态环境保护和经济发展是矛盾对立的关系，是鱼和熊掌不可兼得的两难选择","layout":null,"font-size":32},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"djdkk4k791s0","created":1781927439157,"text":"根本上，二者是辩证统一、相辅相成的关系","layout":null,"font-size":32},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"djdkk634ezc0","created":1781927442478,"text":"揭示了保护生态环境就是保护生产力，改善生态环境就是发展生产力的道理","layout":null,"font-size":32},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"djdkl1ihwrk0","created":1781927510888,"text":"  - 绿水青山既是自然财富、生态财富，又是社会财富、经济财富  ","font-size":32},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"djdkl1ii3nc0","created":1781927510888,"text":"  - 处理好绿水青山和金山银山的关系，关键在人，关键在思路","font-size":32},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"id":"djdkl56h4y80","created":1781927518868,"text":"把生态文明建设摆在全局工作的突出位置","font-size":32},"children":[{"data":{"id":"djdkl7ffipc0","created":1781927523763,"text":"  - 生态文明建设是重大经济问题，也是关系党的使命宗旨的重大政治问题、关系民生福祉的重大社会问题 ","font-size":32},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"djdkl7ffduo0","created":1781927523763,"text":"  - 生态文明建设战略地位更加凸显   ","font-size":32},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"djdkl7ffbpc0","created":1781927523763,"text":"  - 生态文明制度体系更加健全  ","font-size":32},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"djdkl7fg0dc0","created":1781927523764,"text":"  - 污染防治和生态保护更加有力","font-size":32},"children":[]}]}]},{"data":{"id":"djdklawnn340","created":1781927531335,"text":"建设美丽中国","font-size":32},"children":[{"data":{"id":"djdkldeqfdc0","created":1781927536782,"text":"加快形成绿色生产方式和生活方式","layout_right_offset":{"x":11.000000000000114,"y":0},"font-size":32},"children":[{"data":{"id":"djdkma8lcrk0","created":1781927608244,"text":"  - 绿色发展是新发展理念的重要内容，是发展观的一场深刻革命  ","font-size":32},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"djdkma8l83c0","created":1781927608244,"text":"  - 加快推动产业结构、能源结构、交通运输结构等调整优化 ","font-size":32},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"djdkma8lm3c0","created":1781927608244,"text":"  - 推进各类资源节约集约利用   ","font-size":32},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"djdkma8llm80","created":1781927608244,"text":"  - 积极稳妥推进碳达峰碳中和  ","font-size":32},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"djdkma8l4qo0","created":1781927608244,"text":"  - 健全绿色发展的保障体系  ","font-size":32},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"djdkma8lddc0","created":1781927608244,"text":"  - 坚持把建设美丽中国转化为全体人民自觉行动","font-size":32},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"id":"djdkmcixbgg0","created":1781927613222,"text":"坚持山水林田湖草沙一体化保护和系统治理","font-size":32},"children":[{"data":{"id":"djdkme6cdh40","created":1781927616815,"text":"  - 山水林田湖草沙是一个生命共同体，是不可分割的生态系统","font-size":32},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"djdkme6cr1k0","created":1781927616816,"text":"  - 加快实施重要生态系统保护和修复重大工程 ","font-size":32},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"djdkme6cy9k0","created":1781927616816,"text":"  - 推进自然保护地体系建设  ","font-size":32},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"djdkme6cl7k0","created":1781927616816,"text":"  - 科学推进荒漠化、石漠化、水土流失综合治理，持续开展大规模国土绿化行动。","font-size":32},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"djdkme6czm80","created":1781927616816,"text":"  - 推行草原森林河流湖泊湿地休养生息","font-size":32},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"id":"djdkmg75rcw0","created":1781927621218,"text":"用最严格制度最严密法治保护生态环境","font-size":32},"children":[{"data":{"id":"djdkmhxywxc0","created":1781927625016,"text":"  - 保护生态环境必须依靠制度、依靠法治","font-size":32},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"djdkmhxz3og0","created":1781927625016,"text":"  - 实行最严格的生态环境保护制度  ","font-size":32},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"djdkmhxyya00","created":1781927625016,"text":"  - 全面建立资源高效利用制度 ","font-size":32},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"djdkmhxynrc0","created":1781927625016,"text":"  - 严明生态环境保护责任制度 ","font-size":32},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"djdkmhxz7q00","created":1781927625016,"text":"  - 制度的生命力在于执行，关键在真抓，靠的是严管","font-size":32},"children":[]}]}]},{"data":{"id":"djdkmkfczjk0","created":1781927630421,"text":"共谋全球生态文明建设之路","font-size":32},"children":[{"data":{"id":"djdkmooln340","created":1781927639687,"text":"1. 保护人类共同家园  ","font-size":32},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"djdkmoolgn40","created":1781927639687,"text":"2. 共建清洁美丽世界","font-size":32},"children":[{"data":{"id":"djdkms888kw0","created":1781927647404,"text":"  - 坚持以人为本  ","font-size":32},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"djdkms888tc0","created":1781927647404,"text":"  - 坚持科学治理  ","font-size":32},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"djdkms88zmw0","created":1781927647405,"text":"  - 坚持多边主义  ","font-size":32},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"djdkms88u9c0","created":1781927647405,"text":"  - 坚持共同但有区别的责任原则","font-size":32},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"id":"djdkmq463i00","created":1781927642805,"text":"积极推动全球可持续发展","font-size":32},"children":[{"data":{"id":"djdkmtkeuaw0","created":1781927650318,"text":"  - 积极参与全球气候治理 ","font-size":32},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"djdkmtkfxps0","created":1781927650319,"text":"  - 积极推进全球生物多样性治理  ","font-size":32},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"djdkmtkfqs00","created":1781927650319,"text":"  - 积极打造绿色“ 一带一路”","font-size":32},"children":[]}]}]}]},"template":"right","theme":"fresh-blue","version":"1.4.43"}